00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:44.043
So anyway I'm gonna begin today by,
briefly, just for

00:06:44.043 --> 00:06:47.865
five minutes, going through sort of a
basic idea behind the changes that I

00:06:47.865 --> 00:06:50.690
